; Read-only negotiated synchronous-speed ladder. Tests 5.0 through 10.0 MB/s,
; validates two 512 KiB reads at each accepted rate and resets between steps.
FailAt 21
Echo "Experimental sync speed ladder: read-only, 5 through 10 MB/s."
Set u `MCDiag FINDUNIT`
MCDiag UNIT $u SYNC FAST LOG DF0:mcsync-fast.log
Echo "Done. The log is DF0:mcsync-fast.log."
